                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My grandfather and father paid poll taxes to exercise the right to vote. The American people fought to ensure that no person ever has to pay that price again.\n\nThe Trump Administration and Congressional Republicans want to take us back to a time when you had to pay to vote.\u00a0\n\nLast night, I led a special order hour of @TheBlackCaucus to make clear we won\u2019t stand idly by and let that happen.",
