                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The American people have rallied and shown up time and time again to send a clear message to the Trump Administration and Congressional Republicans: don\u2019t touch our Medicaid, Social Security, nutrition programs, veterans benefits and other popular programs.\n\nBut House Republicans\u2019 budget would slash all of these \u2014 and real lives hang in the balance.",
